	(text "25 MHz +/-50 ppm crystal (RTL8211FDI: +/-50 ppm incl. first-year aging and load caps).\nC251/C252 = 2*(CL - Cstray): 27p for CL=18pF; adjust to the crystal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0a320eb4-7918-4019-93ad-d0e258218552")
	)
	(text "DVDD_RG decoupling C256-C258: pin 28 =\ninternal 1.8 V RGMII/MDIO I/O LDO output\n(CFG_LDO=10), caps only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 238.76 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "251f6af9-c8b7-418b-a262-dcad492e43c1")
	)
	(text "U10 RTL8211FDI-CG (replaces KSZ9031RNX; JLC stock). Configured over MDIO; all nine CONFIG pins have external 4K7\npulls as data sheet 7.8 requires (see the strap note below): PHY address 1, PLLOFF=0, TXDLY=0, RXDLY=1, CFG_EXT=0,\nCFG_LDO=10 -> internal RGMII/MDIO I/O LDO at 1.8 V. Set RGMII delays in software (phy-mode rgmii-id).\nSupplies: DVDD33/AVDD33 3.3 V (AVDD33 via FB1), internal LDO_OUT 1.0 V -> PHY1V0 (AVDD10/DVDD10 only),\nDVDD_RG = internal 1.8 V LDO output -> PHY_RG (caps, RX strap and INTB pull-ups). RSET 2K49 1%. MDIO pull-up 1K5.\nPHYRSTB is a 3.3 V input: driven by U42 ch3 (eth_rst_n 1.8 V -> phy_rst_n 3.3 V). Hold low >= 10 ms,\nwait >= 50 ms before MDIO access. LED2 (active low) drives the J9 green LED; set LCR (page 0xd04 reg 0x10) for link/act.\n3V3 rise time must be >= 0.5 ms (U8 AP61202 soft-start 0.5 ms typ: conditionally OK per data sheet table 53)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 173.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5c2cd329-2382-4619-b16b-f654eb110501")
	)
	(text "J9: HanRun HR911130A (LCSC C54408, as on the Zynq board).\nTCT (1) = PHY-side centre taps, all 4 pairs -> C255 100n to GND.\nCHS (10) and shield -> GND. Green LED 11(+)/12 <- PHY LED2\n(1000M link/act, active low, 3.3 V, R250 330R); R268 is also\nthe CFG_LDO1 strap. Yellow LED 13/14 unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5e607833-feda-490c-a5e5-b5ffe0d874d5")
	)
	(text "RGMII series 22R: R251-R256 (TX, HPS -> PHY) place at the HPS end, R257-R262 (RX) at U10."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
